# --- added 2026-09-21 -------------------------------------------------------
# Raw summary statistics. *.csv and *.gz were already ignored, but the raw
# ITEM/CCDF files are .txt and were slipping through -- `git add -A` would have
# staged 2.2 GB, which GitHub rejects at 100 MB/file. These belong in a data
# archive with a DOI, not in git; normalize_sumstats.py regenerates the
# .norm.csv.gz inputs from them.
**/data/*_sumstats.txt
**/data/*.txt
Unique.cf4genes2*.txt

# Index files alongside ignored .gz
**/*.tbi

